# V2.10 evaluation reports - regenerated every run (scripts/run_evaluation.py),
# not intentionally versioned (only eval/baselines/*.json is - Section 108)
eval/reports/*.json
eval/reports/*.md

# V2.12 learning-cycle reports and audit ledger - regenerated every run
